designer_notes = "THE TUTORIAL'S SPARRING PARTNER (Luke, 2026-11-01: ROLES_PREP.md section 4, T1-T5): stands in the camp's yard (a `sparring_skeleton` point) and fights whoever steps within notice_m, slowly (its kit) and softly (10 % damage); a ring closes on each blow (parry_ring, the yard only). No XP, no loot: it is for learning. Lots of health, so it rarely falls; if it does, it is back after regents.foe_respawn_s."
